{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3d6f3bff-1218-8fb1-9735-835a2f86aa5f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:25:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:19:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:19:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. My name is Linh Rahman. I am calling about the storm drain, it is flooding the street in front of my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry to hear that. Where are you located, Ms. Rahman?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-five Ocean Avenue. Forty-five. It is the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-five Ocean Avenue, Ocean Drive side. Got it. And what's going on there right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The water is over the curb, and it goes across the sidewalk, all the way. It is coming from the drain, the drain is not taking the water. This rain, it started Wednesday and finish today, and the water is still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:20:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that soaker was a lot. Is it up near your property, or in the road only?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. Road and sidewalk. And, um, a delivery truck got stuck this morning. A big truck, he try to go through, and he stuck in the water. Somebody have to help him back out. Took maybe twenty minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Was anyone hurt, or any damage to the truck that you saw?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody hurt. The truck, I think okay. But it is dangerous, the cars go slow and the water splash on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Writing this down: standing water over the curb, across the sidewalk, truck stuck this morning. Anything blocking the drain that you can see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:21:40-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there were leaves. A lot of leaves on the grate. I went out and clear them with my hands, with gloves. It helped. The water go down, but only ten minutes. Ten minutes, then it come back again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:21:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you pulled the leaves off and it drained for a bit, then backed up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:22:08-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So I think the problem is not only leaves. Something is wrong under there. The pipe maybe is blocked. Nobody is looking at this, and I am tired of looking at this water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. It could be a clogged line below the grate, and that's something the crew would have to check. Has this drain done this before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:22:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, every time it rains hard, it is like this. Every time. I see it many times already, and the city does not fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:22:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll note that it's a repeat issue at that location. Let me get the crew side of this in the system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I am on my best behavior for this call, you know. I want you to hear I am polite."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate that, and you've been fine. Nothing to worry about on that front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. But please, somebody must come. Today if possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark it as urgent because of the truck and the water over the sidewalk. I can't tell you exactly when a crew gets out there, they're stacked up after this storm, but it goes to the top of the list for flooding on the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand they are busy. But it is road safety. The truck, the people walking, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:23:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, and that's in the notes. Can I get a good number for you, in case the crew needs to ask anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:24:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-three. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-three. Perfect. Anything else about the location? Is the drain right at the corner or midblock?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:24:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in front of my house, near the curb, the middle of my front, not the corner. Forty-five Ocean Avenue, right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Midblock, in front of forty-five. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:24:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And I would like a call back when it is done. When the crew finish. So I know it is fixed, not just they look and leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put a request in the notes for a call back to you once the work is completed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:24:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Because last time, nobody tell me anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll make sure the note is clear. In the meantime, if the water gets deeper or a car stalls out, call back right away, and if it's an emergency, call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:25:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. I will keep the gloves ready. Maybe I clear the leaves again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:25:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just be careful out there near the traffic, and don't stand in the road to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:25:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I am careful. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Rahman. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
